    <string name="about_msg">This secure PDF reader app was created to provide greater security when viewing your PDF documents. With advanced encryption features and the ability to store files in hidden directories, we seek to guarantee your privacy.</string>
    <string name="tips_msg">To improve your privacy, we recommend that you use the encryption function for your PDF documents. Also, try to keep your most sensitive documents in hidden directories. Remember to back up regularly.</string>
    <string name="why_encrypt_msg">Encrypting your PDFs is crucial to ensure that only authorized people can access them. This is especially important if you share your device with others or if your files are sensitive, such as business or personal documents.</string>
    <string name="privacy_msg">Hidden directories are an excellent way to add an extra layer of security for your files. These directories are not easily accessible unless you know where they are, making them perfect for storing sensitive files.</string>
